   "slug": "ahmedabdi-uk-news-worth-your-time",
   "body": "<p>Ahmedabdi.uk is a news and commentary website. It brings together current stories, opinion and analysis in one easy-to-read place, for people who want to stay informed without wading through noise.</p><p><br></p><p>I started it because I wanted somewhere that explains events clearly and gives space to thoughtful opinion. The aim is not to shout the loudest, but to be worth your time. Each piece tries to be clear, fair and honest about what is fact and what is a point of view.</p><p><br></p><p>What you will find here</p><p><br></p><p>News: The latest stories, written plainly and kept up to date.</p><p>Tech: What is changing in technology, and what it means for ordinary people and businesses.</p><p>Opinions: Considered views and arguments on the issues of the day. Opinion pieces are always marked as opinion, so you know when you are reading a view rather than a report.</p><p>About and Contact: Who is behind the site, and how to reach me.</p><p><br></p><p>How the site works</p><p><br></p><p>Ahmedabdi.uk is independent, and it is built to be fast and simple to use on any phone or computer. The news ticker at the top carries the latest headlines, and the side columns make it easy to find older stories and longer reads.</p>",
